  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nc.26.25 ACRES OF AGRICULTURAL LAND\nCUILTEBO,\nCLAREMORRIS, CO. MAYO\n\nFOLIO: MY4358\n\nAVAILABLE IN ONE OR TWO LOTS\n\nASKING PRICE: €155,000 O.N.O.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market approximately 26.25 acres of mixed-quality agricultural land situated in the townland of Cuiltebo, Claremorris, Co. Mayo.\n\nLocated in a well-established farming district, this substantial parcel represents an excellent opportunity for an existing farmer wishing to expand their holding or for a purchaser seeking a sizeable block of agricultural land.\n\nThe lands have been actively farmed down through the years and comprise a mixture of agricultural ground with potential for continued farming and further improvement.\n\nThe property is well fenced, with water laid on, and benefits from extensive road frontage.\n\nThe holding is being offered for outright sale and may be purchased in one or two lots, providing flexibility to prospective purchasers.\n\nGENERAL FEATURES\n\n• Approximately 26.25 acres\n• Folio MY4358\n• Mixed-quality agricultural lands\n• Actively farmed\n• Well fenced\n• Water laid on\n• Extensive road frontage\n• Available in one or two lots\n• Established farming district\n• Convenient to Claremorris\n\nASKING PRICE\n\n€155,000 O.N.O.\n\n\nVIEWING\n\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a workable agricultural holding in a sought-after farming area.\n\nFor maps, further particulars or to arrange an inspection of the lands, contact the Sole Selling Agents:\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel: 086 213 0723\n\nOffice: 094 936 2216\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD.\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nDISCLAIMER\n\nThese particulars, including acreages, boundaries, road frontage, services and descriptions, are provided for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. All areas are approximate and intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided.",
